              "tweet_ids": []
            },
            {
              "id": "1a.2",
              "text": "Evacuations occurred from Estenwick and Dray Corners, with significant infrastructure damage including destruction of Route 12 and a grain elevator in Dray Corners, and damage in the Millrow district and farm belt.",
